'''Utopia''' ([[Genonian language|Genonian]]: 𐑷𐑑𐑭𐑐𐑦𐑨), also known by [[Utopia (Geno)#Names|many other names]], is the capital and largest city of [[Geno]]. 

==Names==
Due to the controversial name of [[wikipedia:utopia|utopia]], referring to a community that possesses highly desirable or near-perfect qualities for its residents, many governments throughout [[Basis]] refuse to call Geno's capital by its official name. In most languages, the word ''Utopia'' is used with ''Geno'' in parenthesis, as in the title of this page. Other similar nomenclature are used, such as ''Geno's Utopia'' or ''Genonian Utopia''. 

In [[Qymish language|Qymish]], the [[Royal academy of the Qymish language]] and the [[Royal Ministry of Foreign Affairs (Qym)|Royal Ministry of Foreign Affairs]] both stipulate the name of Geno's capital city is Ⰴⰶⰵⱀⱁⰿⰹⰵⱄⱅ ''Dzhenomiest'' which translates to "Geno City". 

